{
	"_note": "The village (rebuilt 2026-11-14 after the Arashiyama-style plan; the old one is git tag town-classic): a north-south main street (x 12-14) from the lane to Kaminoda (north edge, x 13-14) down to the riverside walk (y 30) and the wooden bridge (x 12-14, y 31-33) that crosses to Minamino (south edge). West: the farm lane (y 9-10) to the farm gate, the bamboo grove with the little shrine and its torii (north-west), the post office by the lane (door 9, 8; Ren lives in the back), the temple grounds behind a fence with their gate on the street (y 17-18): the hall, raked gravel and the garden pond (fishing: the village water in data/fish.json), Kota's family's house by the river (door 8, 29) with the carp streamers' socket west of it. East: Grandma Tome's house (door 18, 3), the Kurogane Smithy (door 15, 8; Hachiro lives there) and the Hinata Clinic (door 22, 8; Dr. Yae; a collapse wakes the farmer there) along an alley (y 9), the station (scenery), the road east to Sakurazaka (y 20-21), the Yorozu Store (door 18, 24) with Sayo's side door (20, 24), two more shops (scenery). Doors open by their `hours` and say `closed` otherwise. The two store_sign props are the store's new sign (flag sayo_sign, old / new, heart_sayo_5). Format: README.md, Maps.",
